Package: OryzaProbe
Type: Package
Title: Convert Rice Microarray Probe IDs to RAP-DB Gene IDs
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(person("Youming", "Liu", role = c("aut", "cre","cph"),
    email = "lym@g.ecc.u-tokyo.ac.jp") )
Description: Converts probe identifiers from the rice microarray platforms
    GPL6864, GPL8852, and GPL2025 to targets from the Rice Annotation Project
    Database (RAP-DB). Conversion preserves input order, reports unmapped and
    non-RAP annotations, handles one-to-many mappings explicitly, and can
    combine multiple probes per target using the mean, maximum, or minimum.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.6)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://github.com/lym-bioinfo/OryzaProbe,
    https://cran.r-project.org/package=OryzaProbe
BugReports: https://github.com/lym-bioinfo/OryzaProbe/issues
